 {\xml}<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf8"?><autotext version="2" editMode="2"><fields><field type="3" start="0" length="320"><name>Fleischner</name><choices><choice name="">SOLID</choice><choice name="_Single or multiple"></choice><choice name="__&lt;6 mm low risk">No follow-up needed based on Fleischner Criteria.</choice><choice name="__&lt;6 mm high risk">Optional follow-up CT in 12 months may be considered.</choice><choice name="__&lt;6 mm unknown risk">Follow-up options based on Fleischner Criteria:
